\pard\tx2460\fs28\fi-2000\li2460\fc0\cf0 DESCRIPTION	This structure describes the attributes of a compressed sound.  It immediately follows the general SNDSoundStruct header.  If the sound data isn't compressed, this subheader is absent.  The structure's fields are\

\fs20 \

\pard\tx5480\tx8500\fs28\li2840\fc0\cf0 originalSize	The size of the uncompressed data, in bytes\
method	The compression format (see ªCompression Formats,º below)\
numDropped	The number of dropped bits, if applicable\
encodeLength	The number of samples represented by an encoded block\

